# {{dist}}

A gig for [gigai](https://github.com/karthik446/gigai). Generated by `gigai gig new {{name}}`.

```
gigai gig check .                # manifest, entry point, help text, docs, tests
gigai gig install .              # into the gigai you run (a `uv tool` install or a venv)
gigai {{name}} capture --label first
gigai {{name}} show
```

Layout: `src/{{package}}/gig.toml` is the contract with core (read without importing this package);
`cli.py` is the Click group mounted as `gigai {{name}}`; `docs/` ships the user page and the CLI manual;
`tests/test_contract.py` is what `gigai gig check` runs.
